    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JETAMERICA\nFrom\nLong Beach\nTo\nChicago\nO'Hare\n(ORD)\nTo\nDallas-\nFt. Worth\n(DFW)\nDAILY SCHEDULE\nFlight Leave\nArrive\nFlight Leave\n102\n8:00 a.m.\n1:38 p.m.\n112\n11:30 a.m.\n4:59 p.m.\n202\n222\n122\n6:30 p.m. 12:08 a.m.\nArrive\n9:30 a.m.\n1:59 p.m.\n6:00 p.m. 10:40 p.m.\nEffective December 3, 1982\nAsk your travel agent or phone:\nLong Beach\nLos Angeles\n(213) 595-0555\n(213) 636-7010\nOrange County (714) 752-4933 • South Orange County (714) 859-8348\nLong Beach Airport\nLong Beach Airport is an easy drive from downtown Los\nAngeles and Hollywood, and for Orange County passengers,\nit's much closer than LAX (now being renovated for the 1984\nOlympics). Parking is right at the terminal. Baggage and\ncheck-in are super quick.\n11\nHarbor Fwy.-\nSan Diego Fwy.-405\nPacific Coast Hwy.\nLos\nAngeles\nAirport\nDowntown\nLos\nAngeles\nFwy.\nong Beach\nFwy.-605\nSan Gabriel\nSanta Ana\nArtesia Fwy.- 91\nMovieland\nFwy.-5\nWax Museum •\nAnaheim\nStadium\n•\nKnott's Berry Farm\nLong Beach\nDisneyland •\nAirport\nLong Beach\nGarden Grove Fwy.\nLong Beach Convention\n• \u0026 Eniertainment Center\nMarineland\nPacific Ocean\n• Long Beach Harbor\nQueen Mary •\n\u0026 Naval Base\nCatalina Island\nLion\nCountry •\n• Safari\nNewport,\nBeach",
      "JETAMERICA\nTo\nLong Beach\nFrom\nFrom\nChicago\nO'Hare\n(ORD)\nDallas-\nFt. Worth\n(DFW)\nFlight\n101\n111\n121\nDAILY SCHEDULE\nLeave\nArrive\nFlight\n8:00 a.m. 10:12 a.m.\n2:55 p.m.\n5:07 p.m.\n201\n211\n6:45 p.m.\n8:57 p.m.\nLeave\nArrive\n8:00 a.m.\n3:10 p.m.\n9:00 a.m.\n4:05 p.m.\nEffective December 3, 1982\nNow you can fly non-stop to Southern California\nwithout ever seeing Los Angeles International Airport.\nAsk your travel agent or phone:\nOutside California\n800-421-7574\nJet America Airlines, Inc.\n2895 Temple Avenue\nLong Beach, CA 90806\n12-82"
